						Type "strot" in the "inv_lot_id5_vis" autocomplete
						Enter "01-01-2030" in the "inv_exp_date5" date
				Begin "Receive an item with only a manufacturer"
					Begin "Location 1"
						Select "Hospital" in the @dropdown in the "Site" cell@xpath=//select[@name='inv_transloc6']
						@Wait@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX(30)
						Verify "value=0" "inv_stockpile_id6" dropdown
