					Verify exists the "Receiving Fingertip Bandage (20)" text
					Verify exists the 2nd "Receiving Fingertip Bandage (20)" text
			Begin "Single Use Lot"
				Click the "Show Inventory" charttab
				Click the @"Edit" link in the "Stomach Tube" row@xpath=//td[contains(.,'Stomach Tube')]/following-sibling::td/a[contains(.,'Edit')]
